{"parentUuid":"c16e28f4-94e6-4b0b-938e-9c0bc90cd2ad","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CcoWExuPp1nqJgAYXXvJ4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Full diagnosis complete. Here's the chain, end to end.\n\n## Why the forward_eval gate has been blind since April\n\n**The PIT horizon-backfill step is not wired into any automated run.**\n\n`warm_price_cache.py` has two modes:\n1. **`--snapshot`** (anchor) — freezes today's close. Daily run calls this (`warm_price_pit=True`), so cache dirs exist through 07-07, each with `horizons_filled=[]`.\n2. **`--backfill-all`** (maturation) — fills h5/h20 forward prices *once those future dates arrive*. Daily run guards this behind `price_pit_backfill=False` and **never passes `--price-pit-backfill`**. Grep across `scripts/` and `*.sh` finds no cron passing it either.\n\nSo every day an empty-horizon anchor is written, and **nothing ever returns to fill the forward returns as they mature.** The forward_eval gate needs h20, finds it only on dates ≤ **2026-04-20**, and takes the 10 most recent → the frozen `04-03 .. 04-20` window, identical byte-for-byte every run.\n\nThe two-stage boundary (`[5,20]` → `[5]` → `[]`) pinpoints the last time `--backfill-all` was run manually: **~May 8–11**. It filled everything matured as of then (h20 for anchors ≤04-20, h5 for anchors ≤05-08) and has not run since.\n\n## Impact\n- The gate the model docs call the **live NO_MODEL_CHANGE forward-validation gate** is effectively **non-functional** — it's replaying a 3-month-old window, so it can neither pass nor fail on current data. Any decision keyed to \"forward IC is holding up\" is running blind.\n- The April number itself (`−0.0064`) is misleading anyway: **median +0.0126**, dragged negative by one tail date (04-03, −0.1331) and a contaminated partial-universe date (04-15, n=111).\n\n## The fix (data-maintenance, write-once, safe)\n```bash\npython tools/warm_price_cache.py --backfill-all \\\n    --price-csv production_data/price_history.csv \\\n    --cache-base data/caches/price_pit/PIT/ \\\n    --through-date 2026-07-07\n```\nThis fills all matured horizons, advancing the forward_eval window from April to ~early June (anchors whose 20 trading days have now elapsed). Then the gate reflects real recent IC. The durable fix is to wire `--price-pit-backfill` into the daily cron.\n\nI have **not** run anything — this modifies the PIT caches, so it's your call. Want me to:\n1. **Run the backfill now** and re-evaluate the gate to see the true recent IC, and/or\n2. **Save this to memory** (forward-eval gate blind since April — unwired PIT backfill), and/or\n3. Draft the daily-cron wiring fix so it doesn't recur?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2759,"cache_read_input_tokens":77526,"output_tokens":1591,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2759,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1591,"cache_read_input_tokens":77526,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2759,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2759},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CcoWEwvrpB7prcwtvscnK","type":"assistant","uuid":"e3c18a65-a0c6-4da9-aa30-628f4d02a2a4","timestamp":"2026-07-07T22:43:13.763Z","session_id":"61ba5fc3-05ad-4fb5-90d2-919f0eba7c7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/arrenchulz","sessionId":"61ba5fc3-05ad-4fb5-90d2-919f0eba7c7f","version":"2.1.203","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
