{"parentUuid":"712e98b0-0e38-4ac9-8e16-48ba815fa184","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CcobEFkDmqE13Axv2aVSu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Commit landed: **`d8428bab`** — passed all pre-commit hooks (black, isort, flake8, detect-secrets, semgrep governance, docs-update-check). Only `tools/run_daily_production.py` is in it; `keys.txt` and the 23 foreign files were left untouched.\n\n**The push is blocked** — your `block-dangerous-git.sh` guardrail hook intercepts any `git push`, so I can't run it. You'll need to push it yourself. Easiest is to run it in this session with the `!` prefix:\n\n```\n! cd /mnt/c/Projects/biotech_screener/biotech-screener && git push -u origin fix/forward-eval-pit-backfill-default\n```\n\nNow the third deliverable — saving the memory note."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":965,"cache_read_input_tokens":99067,"output_tokens":1692,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":965,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1692,"cache_read_input_tokens":99067,"cache_creation_input_tokens":965,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":965},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CcobEEFBXFsE6JqXM7WhD","type":"assistant","uuid":"3fa02361-3c14-416d-9048-2fc536d2a092","timestamp":"2026-07-07T23:48:21.813Z","session_id":"61ba5fc3-05ad-4fb5-90d2-919f0eba7c7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/arrenchulz","sessionId":"61ba5fc3-05ad-4fb5-90d2-919f0eba7c7f","version":"2.1.203","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
{"parentUuid":"3fa02361-3c14-416d-9048-2fc536d2a092","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CcobEFkDmqE13Axv2aVSu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01SV5AT8fC5j7bayfV4GNK7p","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/home/arrenchulz/.claude/projects/-home-arrenchulz/memory/project_forward_eval_gate_stale_2026_07_07.md","content":"---\nname: project-forward-eval-gate-stale-2026-07-07\ndescription: forward_eval gate was blind since April — PIT horizon backfill never wired into daily run; fixed default-on, real recent IC is negative\nmetadata:\n  type: project\n---\n\nThe `forward_eval` gate in the biotech screener daily run (`tools/run_daily_production.py` → `tools/forward_eval_gate.py`) was **frozen** — byte-identical `mean_ic=-0.0064`, n=10, window `2026-04-03..04-20` on every run for months (07-01/03/06/07 all identical).\n\n**Root cause**: the gate discovers evaluable dates by scanning PIT price caches (`data/caches/price_pit/PIT/<date>/index.json`) for those whose 20d horizon is in `horizons_filled`. The daily run created the price *anchor* every day (`warm_price_pit=True`) but the *maturation backfill* (`warm_price_cache.py --backfill-all`, which fills h5/h20 once forward dates arrive) was opt-in (`--price-pit-backfill`, default off) and **never passed by cron**. So no cache past ~2026-04-20 ever had h20 filled → gate could only find April dates. Two-stage decay boundary (`[5,20]`→`[5]`→`[]`) showed the last manual backfill was ~May 8–11.\n\n**Impact**: the gate the model docs call the *live NO_MODEL_CHANGE forward-validation gate* was blind to current data for months.\n\n**Actions taken 2026-07-07**:\n- Ran `python3 tools/warm_price_cache.py --backfill-all --price-csv production_data/price_history.csv --cache-base data/caches/price_pit/PIT/ --through-date 2026-07-07`. h20 now filled through 2026-06-03 (52 dates). Caches are **git-ignored** (nothing to commit).\n- Re-ran gate on refreshed window (2026-05-13..06-03): **mean_ic=-0.0597, median=-0.1329** — a real, materially negative signal, driven by a deeply negative mid-May cluster (05-13→05-20, IC -0.13 to -0.22) recovering into early June (+0.07 to +0.15). The stale gate had been masking this.\n- Fix committed `d8428bab` on branch `fix/forward-eval-pit-backfill-default`: mirrored the `--no-warm-price-pit` opt-out pattern — backfill now defaults on; `--no-price-pit-backfill` opts out. **Push blocked by git-guardrails hook** — operator must push manually; PR not yet open.\n\n**Why**: forward-eval health is a governance gate; a frozen ledger is worse than a failing one because it looks stable.\n**How to apply**: after the fix lands + next daily run, confirm the manifest `forward_eval` window has advanced off April. The negative mid-May IC is a real model-health item to investigate — relates to [[project_model_investability_verdict_2026_06_26]] and the forward-validation window in [[scoped_work_freeze_2026_06_22]]. Repo is a shared checkout — [[feedback_shared_checkout_concurrency_2026_06_30]] applies (23 foreign dirty files + untracked keys.txt were present; left untouched).\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":965,"cache_read_input_tokens":99067,"output_tokens":1692,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":965,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1692,"cache_read_input_tokens":99067,"cache_creation_input_tokens":965,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":965},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CcobEEFBXFsE6JqXM7WhD","type":"assistant","uuid":"e267fdd6-212a-4448-a0ff-2535924c54b2","timestamp":"2026-07-07T23:48:37.027Z","session_id":"61ba5fc