{"parentUuid":"6d036a81-7368-465a-b6aa-b4ea6e849e8c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CcobWBeMxE3YcigK1mEZg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EtiyxdFQWngjzsou1z1CPn","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /mnt/c/Projects/biotech_screener/biotech-screener 2>/dev/null\ngh pr create --base main --head fix/forward-eval-pit-backfill-default \\\n  --title \"fix(daily): backfill matured PIT forward returns by default\" \\\n  --body \"$(cat <<'EOF'\n## Problem\n\nThe `forward_eval` gate discovers evaluable dates by scanning PIT price caches (`data/caches/price_pit/PIT/<date>/index.json`) for those whose 20d horizon is in `horizons_filled`. The daily run created the price **anchor** every day (`warm_price_pit=True`) but the **maturation backfill** (`warm_price_cache.py --backfill-all`) was opt-in (`--price-pit-backfill`, default off) and never passed by cron.\n\nResult: no cache past ~2026-04-20 ever had its h20 horizon filled, so the rolling-IC window was **frozen** at `2026-04-03..04-20` — byte-identical `mean_ic=-0.0064` on every run for months. The gate the model docs call the *live NO_MODEL_CHANGE forward-validation gate* was effectively blind to current data.\n\n## Evidence\n\nA manual `--backfill-all` (run 2026-07-07) advanced h20 coverage through `2026-06-03` and the gate window to `2026-05-13..06-03`, revealing a real signal the stale gate had masked:\n\n- **mean_ic = -0.0597** (median -0.1329), vs the stale -0.0064\n- deeply negative **mid-May cluster** (05-13→05-20, IC -0.13 to -0.22) recovering into early June (+0.07 to +0.15)\n\n## Fix\n\nMirror the existing `--no-warm-price-pit` opt-out pattern: the post-promotion backfill now runs **by default** in the daily pipeline; `--no-price-pit-backfill` opts out. Backfill is write-once and safe on reruns.\n\n- `price_pit_backfill` function default `False` → `True`\n- CLI flag `--price-pit-backfill` → `--no-price-pit-backfill`\n- caller wires `price_pit_backfill=not args.no_price_pit_backfill`\n\n## Notes\n\n- No behavior change to the anchor step or gate logic; only whether the backfill runs.\n- Today's promoted `run_manifest` still shows the stale April value; it refreshes on the next daily run once caches are read.\n- Follow-up (not in this PR): investigate the mid-May negative forward IC.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nEOF\n)\" 2>&1 | tail -8","description":"Open the pull request via gh"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6,"cache_read_input_tokens":114377,"output_tokens":966,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":966,"cache_read_input_tokens":114377,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CcobW7S6s7A54Dm7FyHcR","type":"assistant","uuid":"7e7625af-69f6-4831-b889-af49bd6763e5","timestamp":"2026-07-07T23:52:03.533Z","session_id":"61ba5fc3-05ad-4fb5-90d2-919f0eba7c7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/arrenchulz","sessionId":"61ba5fc3-05ad-4fb5-90d2-919f0eba7c7f","version":"2.1.203","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
