{"parentUuid":"f115e539-a0f1-4664-9fad-b83f66c0782b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CcpmzoiUUvqSEJMk4d5m9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EcWPwPe9fnFC9y8iDKvv5J","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"WT=/tmp/claude-1000/-home-arrenchulz/61ba5fc3-05ad-4fb5-90d2-919f0eba7c7f/scratchpad/fix-wt\ncd \"$WT\" 2>/dev/null\ngit add tools/forward_eval_gate.py tests/test_forward_eval_gate.py\ngit commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nfix(forward_eval): scope IC to tradeable set + de-overlap window\n\nThe forward_eval gate computed a full-universe rank IC over the 10 most\nrecent (near-adjacent) snapshots. Both choices made it a noisy proxy:\n\n- Full-universe rank IC penalises the model for not ranking names it\n  correctly excludes; when bottom-ranked/ineligible names bounce, or a\n  distressed name floats to a high composite rank, the IC craters even\n  though the traded book is unaffected.\n- The 10 lookback dates were 1-5 trading days apart, so their 20d-forward\n  windows overlapped ~90% — one market episode counted ~10 times.\n\nChanges (tools/forward_eval_gate.py):\n- scope=\"eligible\" (new default): IC restricted to rows with eligible\n  truthy. Also \"portfolio\", \"top_k\", \"universe\" (legacy). Falls back to\n  universe (with a warning) if the scope column is absent, so a malformed\n  rankings.csv can't silently blank the gate.\n- min_gap_days de-overlap in _discover_pit_dates: greedily keep dates\n  >= gap apart; evaluate_rolling_ic defaults gap to ~horizon trading days\n  (round(horizon*7/5)) so retained forward windows don't overlap.\n- Records scope + min_gap_days in value/threshold for transparency.\n\nDefaults flow to the production caller with no GateConfig change. On the\nreal 2026-05..06 caches this turns the spurious -0.0597 WARN into a\nlegitimate +0.0332 PASS (de-overlap alone already flips the mean positive),\nmatching the autopsy finding that the traded model was fine mid-May.\nWARN-only behaviour and the spearman_ic reuse are unchanged.\n\nAddresses issue #482.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1","description":"Commit forward_eval re-scope"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4426,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1656,"cache_read_input_tokens":297050,"output_tokens":1390,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1656,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4426,"output_tokens":1390,"cache_read_input_tokens":297050,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1656,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1656},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CcpmzjfeNpvWaArjY7JdB","type":"assistant","uuid":"adb34f08-53c0-47bc-952e-fe1458ac1cdc","timestamp":"2026-07-08T14:50:26.325Z","session_id":"61ba5fc3-05ad-4fb5-90d2-919f0eba7c7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/arrenchulz","sessionId":"61ba5fc3-05ad-4fb5-90d2-919f0eba7c7f","version":"2.1.203","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
